{
  "_comment": "PLACEHOLDERS ONLY. Copy to config.json (gitignored) and fill in real values. Angle-bracket <...> strings are required and must be replaced; a missing required key is a load-time error, never a silent production default. Secrets are never values here — they live in untracked files referenced by *_file keys, or in env (the Slack bot token is read from SLACK_BOT_TOKEN, not from config).",

  "remote_user": "<remote-ssh-user>",
  "remote_host": "<remote-sequencing-host>",
  "remote_source_path": "<remote-path-to-list-usually-.>",
